Request for Participation

The LUG program committee would like to invite members of the Lustre community to submit presentation abstracts for inclusion in this year's meeting.  It is not necessary to submit a technical paper, just an abstract of your proposed talk no more than a page in length.  Talks should target a half an hour in length and reflect the work that you or your site are doing with Lustre.  The deadline to submit presentation abstracts is February 14, 2012.  For questions or to submit a presentation abstract, send mail to submissions at lists.opensfs.org or contact the program committee chair, Stephen Simms (ssimms at indiana.edu).

Thank you,
